rs match exactly. All seven and nine conjuncts are correct. In each BODY the first constructor branch directly exact-applies the new production identity at the displayed parameters; the actual imported compiled print also places that application in the first pair component. The remaining branch proves the concrete rational values and endpoint checks. Thus core consumption is not inferred merely from an unused whole-declaration constant.\n+\n+All28 manifest rows and complete file set, actual focused/olean/public-probe success, two standard-three axiom lists, native fences and TYPE/VALUE exports were verified. All1319 prior active source inputs,317 seal inputs and57 addendum inputs remain unchanged. The original failed time-binder annotation candidate is preserved. Only Test is new at HEADcb4fe8ec.\n+\n+This accepts two finite-real canary candidates only. Ordinary proof print elisions are disclosed; no necessity/transitive graph claim. Combined root/Tests/harness/site and independent FINAL remain pending. Whole B4, seven containers, six future claims and Goal remain open. Requested Astra/medium; runtime not independently attested."},{"sha":"95909af5ee99b980c87c0573d53318c672e46c4c","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze-port-v1.json","status":"added","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changes":23,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze-port-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze-port-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze-port-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+{\n+  \"rows\": [\n+    {\n+      \"original\": \"tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-canary-freeze-review-20261011/fresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json\",\n+      \"destination\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze/fresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"fc03ca4e85ffb694d46482fafeec8b24b314c5742e9e319afe6c2fc8ffe72515\",\n+      \"bytes\": 11377\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"original\": \"tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-canary-freeze-review-20261011/fresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.md\",\n+      \"destination\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze/fresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"07a902d96914b5318e92fdd9cae831b06278898abc76ff8baf79c50d3629dc25\",\n+      \"bytes\": 1414\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"original\": \"tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-canary-freeze-review-20261011/prepared-precanary-helper-v1-repair-record.json\",\n+      \"destination\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze/prepared-precanary-helper-v1-repair-record.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"f472cb1b128fe94065c7ed49e03f4157bb96f92afb06596882d21a2201dc8314\",\n+      \"bytes\": 851\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"boundary\": \"Exact copied ignored independent review; original receipt paths retained.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"65aad4200c6b9c76f4918cce8148121a55fdd27a","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2F.gitattributes?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+* -text\n+*.raw -diff"},{"sha":"e955db857fd4853ca1d98a19ac25edd7307e5693","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-canary-freeze/fresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json","status":"added","additions":185,"deletions":0,"changes":185,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2Ffresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2Ffresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-canary-freeze%2Ffresh-independent-canary-freeze-review-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,185 @@\n+{\n+  \"schema_version\": 1,\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:39:02.208932+00:00\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model\": \"GPT-6 Astra\",\n+  \"requested_reasoning_effort\": \"medium\",\n+  \"runtime_independently_attested\": false,\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-canary-freeze-contract\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [],\n+  \"approved_proposal_sha256\": \"475a5e2cf4dde4c5072f5c2f095142bc3ceeabe2ed05d8c39caa50313d5679c1\",\n+  \"approved_core_sha256\": \"61c811c0b1f941ec22ac41f64e555a0e4d4d8dc32b8145ea53808dbdc0fc17da\",\n+  \"approved_header_hashes\": [\n+    \"7d10ab86d93f97a5ac03db64ce96b8759a0a64d7bd440fa5bfbbe666717be75e\",\n+    \"718a2eb714597c34033cc4d35af06b00b3718768cd60799800c6e487c777af64\"\n+  ],\n+  \"approved_checker_sha256\": \"4995903b39c2dbbeadb4e7ddc6e7caa213bd5d96f2c611c1f7119b00dcb7901f\",\n+  \"approved_recorder_sha256\": \"d7d10142361f940c51712e7dd174dfae51ad768f65f87f26decd87d91faf58fc\",\n+  \"scope\": \"Two complete finite-real canary contracts and exact evidence port; prepared checker v2/recorder design only. No Test BODY or execution acceptance/authorization.\",\n+  \"HEAD\": \"40c2f30f7cee38c9d2f716ffdac18a459a5af25a\",\n+  \"seven_slots\": {\n+    \"objects\": \"Real-valued total psi/loss and natural-time points with comparator, arbitrary terminal splice and inclusive cumulative potential.\",\n+    \"quantifiers\": \"Two closed propositions; all eight displayed lets in each are definitions, not new assumptions.\",\n+    \"hypotheses\": \"None; positive horizon is the fixed numeral 1 or 2. No desired identity, optimizer, update or regularity premise.\",\n+    \"conclusions\": \"Each first conjunct is the full unchanged production identity specialized to the same local lets. Seven conjuncts in case1, nine in case2.\",\n+    \"constants\": \"Independent exact rational check: case1 R,A,B,C,D = 0,0,-1/36,0,1/36; case2 = 1,9,-7/2,-1/2,-4.\",\n+    \"indices\": \"Scored times range T, G includes losses0..t, signed drift range(T-1), terminal G(T-1). The splice changes only y(T), not scored points.\",\n+    \"boundaries\": \"Fixed finite-real witnesses only; no T0, generic horizon, actual algorithm, EReal adapter, attained optimizer, or full corrected7.47/15.31 claim.\"\n+  },\n+  \"independent_findings\": [\n+    \"Case1 retains positive terminal gap and correctly negates only the inequality dropping that gap: 0 is not <= -1/36. It is not by itself a formal refutation of an algorithmic source guarantee.\",\n+    \"Case2 retains negative drift -1/2, terminal gap -4 and unscored endpoint distinction x2=100 versus y2=2. The four right-hand components sum exactly to regret1.\",\n+    \"Exact header imports/context are retained. Future combined Test may only deduplicate shared context with exact reconstruction of each complete frozen header.\",\n+    \"Future first conjunct of EACH theorem must actually consume the direct production specialization. A whole-declaration occurrence or unused call alone is insufficient; inspect the first-conjunct construction and compiled VALUE evidence later.\",\n+    \"Fresh blind actor /root/b4_finite_identity_canary_blind disclosed its two-header exposure and inherited generic context; source reviewer /root/adaptive_decoder and this independent reviewer are distinct.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"port_checks\": {\n+    \"rows\": 149,\n+    \"all_origin_and_destination_RAW_hash_size_equal\": true,\n+    \"all_old_statement_seal_inputs_unchanged\": 116,\n+    \"production_unchanged\": true,\n+    \"all_failure_records_preserved\": true,\n+    \"port_is_exact_copy_not_new_run_claim\": true\n+  },\n+  \"type_elaboration\": {\n+    \"both_actual_exit\": 0,\n+    \"exact_reverse_header_conversion_verified\": true,\n+    \"raw_stdout_stderr_hashes_verified\": true,\n+    \"imported_core_olean_sha256\": \"5f57b1aaced956d81cb1f9307ee3bd2278e2df29e7ac61c3fcecd27e493ff9f1\",\n+    \"evidence_scope\": \"Prop-valued definitions and check/print, not proof. Earlier pending production BODY text is historical at its own UTC; current independent production acceptance is separately bound.\"\n+  },\n+  \"prepared_helper_review\": {\n+    \"v1_gap_retained_in\": \"prepared-precanary-helper-v1-repair-record.json\",\n+    \"v2_resolves_H1\": true,\n+    \"v2_complete_own_DOC_RUN_plus_core_set_checked_twice\": true,\n+    \"v2_every_frozen_row_hash_size_rechecked\": true,\n+    \"v2_seal_RAW_and_SHA_unchanged\": true,\n+    \"v2_nonempty_unique_minimum_eight_paths\": true,\n+    \"v2_old_seal_and_self_bytes_checked\": true,\n+    \"v2_clean_HEAD_branch_core_Test_absence_Mathlib_pin_before_after\": true,\n+    \"recorder_complete_active_source_reenumeration_and_actual_selected_ZIP\": true,\n+    \"recorder_five_governance_inputs_in_RAW_and_selected_ZIP\": true,\n+    \"historical_RUN_boundary\": \"Exact own seal plus clean committed HEAD, not whole historical archive RAW/ZIP.\",\n+    \"execution_conditions\": [\n+      \"Exact accepted review and all intended inputs must enter the later parent seal and clean commit.\",\n+      \"Use normal Python without -O; assertions are guards.\",\n+      \"Run exact checker v2 under the pinned recorder, with current leaf-contract and required owned-source CLI arguments.\",\n+      \"Inspect actual argv/streams/exit, matching clean before/after state, full inventories and every ZIP entry in a distinct subsequent review.\"\n+    ],\n+    \"executed_by_reviewer\": false\n+  },\n+  \"review_tooling_note\": \"Two read-only display attempts hit local GBK decoding/encoding errors; rerun with explicit UTF8 and ASCII-only output completed exact checks. No Lean or candidate evidence failure inferred.\",\n+  \"future_sequence\": [\n+    \"parent canary seal\",\n+    \"clean committed pre-canary capture\",\n+    \"independent actual context review\",\n+    \"explicit parent Test BODY authorization\",\n+    \"compiled full BODY/first-conjunct consumer/axiom review\",\n+    \"combined root/Tests/harness/site gates\"\n+  ],\n+  \"remaining_state\": {\n+    \"Test_file_absent\": true,\n+    \"BODY_authorized_by_this_review\": false,\n+    \"whole_B4\": \"OPEN\",\n+    \"containers_open\": 7,\n+    \"future_claims_open\": 6,\n+    \"chapter2\": \"partial\",\n+    \"chapter_accepted\": false,\n+    \"chapter_denominator\": null,\n+    \"Goal\": \"ACTIVE\",\n+    \"main_live_acceptance\": false\n+  },\n+  \"inputs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/docs/contracts/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-v1/canary-freeze-proposal-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256_before\": \"475a5e2cf4dde4c5072f5c2f095142bc3ceeabe2ed05d8c39caa50313d5679c1\",\n+      \"sha256_after\": \"475a5e2cf4dde4c5072f5c2f095142bc3ceeabe2ed05d8c39caa5031