torical maintainer pending paragraphs remain historical; this FINAL supplies bounded local acceptance without rewriting frozen inputs.\n+\n+Scope is local proof-sealed acceptance of this package only. No PURIFIED/native whole-loop, full7.47/15.31, whole B4, seven-container/six-future-claim closure, Chapter2 completion or Goal completion. No push/PR/merge/live acceptance. Worktree retained. Requested Astra/medium; runtime not independently attested."},{"sha":"f14d8ce648b7b3d77713a04c281aab2dadf23bff","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-freeze-port-v1.json","status":"added","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changes":43,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze-port-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze-port-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze-port-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@\n+{\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:10:53.714141+00:00\",\n+  \"rows\": [\n+    {\n+      \"original\": \"tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-freeze-review-20261011/fresh-independent-contract-freeze-review-v1.json\",\n+      \"destination\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-freeze/fresh-independent-contract-freeze-review-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"eaf9e2864cd0acd8c6fe1cc67a4e97d7688138ee33effc9b138657ac5483c686\",\n+      \"bytes\": 20266\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"original\": \"tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-freeze-review-20261011/fresh-independent-contract-freeze-review-v1.md\",\n+      \"destination\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-freeze/fresh-ind