748f6e7b071d2d47efa\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"contract_freeze_review_sha256\": \"eaf9e2864cd0acd8c6fe1cc67a4e97d7688138ee33effc9b138657ac5483c686\",\n+  \"superseded_helper_review_sha256\": \"9d4f7a35b96ccad74e015db9e61edeecbbf0ddadcf7e1248567d29d3b9e658c6\",\n+  \"v2_status\": \"superseded unexecuted preparation, no separate execution approval\",\n+  \"P1\": \"Resolved: each selection unions filesystem rglob active BanditRLProof/Tests .lean, all own DOC/RUN files including ignored/untracked, and tracked paths; repeated exact before/after row equality detects path/byte changes. Current selected roots checked without symlinks.\",\n+  \"P2\": \"Resolved: final RAW re-enumeration followed by repeated core/Test absence, pinned Mathlib HEAD/tracked clean status, root status/HEAD/branch; final receipt names before_after rather than claiming a single check covers both.\",\n+  \"minimum_seal\": \"Nonempty unique path list, all six required header/contract/review/topology/topology-review/helper paths; every SHA checked; header92e0 and contract939a hard-pinned; running helper must equal canonical preparedv3. Actual accepted seal and helper hash remain subject to independent context review after capture.\",\n+  \"windows_path_check\": \"AST confirms all six replace search literals are exactly one backslash character (length1), replaced by slash. Windows str(Path(...)) therefore canonicalizes to expected forward-slash seal paths. Not a two-backslash no-op.\",\n+  \"actual_ZIP_design\": \"Create mode x, sorted path-list exact equality and every archive member SHA against before inventory; full re-enumeration after ZIP checks. No whole historical RUN/Mathlib tree archive claim.\",\n+  \"scope_limitations\": [\n+    \"Mathlib cleanliness refers tracked status and pinned commit; only two exact import source files are additionally RAW archived, not full transitive Mathlib archive.\",\n+    \"Helper assumes this reviewed workspace/path layout and standard non-optimized Python assertions; do not execute under python -O.\",\n+    \"Create-only capture-v3 currently must not exist. Parent must first seal/commit exact inputs and have a clean correct branch.\",\n+    \"No BODY authorization: capture success still requires independent clean preproof-context review and explicit parent action.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"execution_performed\": false,\n+  \"syntax\": \"AST only; top-level capture code never executed\",\n+  \"canonical_writes\": false\n+}"},{"sha":"2aeec292d2d4fcd4371d60920ddaae1eea406d4c","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-freeze/prepared-preproof-helper-review-v3.md","status":"added","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changes":3,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze%2Fprepared-preproof-helper-review-v3.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze%2Fprepared-preproof-helper-review-v3.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-freeze%2Fprepared-preproof-helper-review-v3.md?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Accepted prepared capture helper v3 only (1dbe6223...). P1/P2 repaired: actual on-disk active Lean and owned evidence paths re-enumerated, exact ZIP checked, core/Test absence and Mathlib tracked cleanliness/pinned HEAD repeated after capture. Nonempty unique seal inputs and six minimum paths enforced; header/contract hashes hard-pinned; executing/canonical helper bytes equal. AST confirms Windows backslash replacement handles one character correctly.\n+\n+Versions1/2 retained unexecuted. Contract approval unchanged. Only after exact parent seal/commit and clean branch may helper run without Python optimization; subsequent independent context review and explicit parent BODY authorization remain required. No capture or BODY executed by reviewer."},{"sha":"0c78badcba6fecb331d49bbb47c2378a7c8cbb3b","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-integration/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changes":4,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2F.gitattributes?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@\n+* -text\n+* whitespace=cr-at-eol\n+*.raw -diff\n+*.olean -diff"},{"sha":"8ef6b8cc29231a77db1538e2380b49ee17043da4","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-integration/fresh-independent-integration-metadata-v2-supplement-v1.json","status":"added","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changes":21,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-metadata-v2-supplement-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-metadata-v2-supplement-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-metadata-v2-supplement-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+{\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:51:07.412571+00:00\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium; runtime not independently attested\",\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-metadata-draft-successor-only\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [],\n+  \"approved_manifest_draft_sha256\": \"466e1ea12ca97363ccb70e93dc8289ea84b3c2548931960457aaba2dbd11339b\",\n+  \"prior_review_sha256\": \"413fb1c9350388516d70b2c01e75d24043cd3b889cd7cc9d2c95b91a7c8f5a3f\",\n+  \"v1_preserved_sha256\": \"c790da0c9f3daa847f470ea5de59d825dcb9f86f2c014fb26cecd7359ba06333\",\n+  \"exact_changed_paths\": [\n+    \"/progress_updates/results_ledger\",\n+    \"/progress_updates/teaching_route\",\n+    \"/semantic_roundtrip/remaining_semantic_delta\",\n+    \"/semantic_roundtrip/verdict\"\n+  ],\n+  \"original_semantic_scope_and_evidence_prose_preserved\": true,\n+  \"pure_validate_contract_errors\": [],\n+  \"M1_M2_M3_resolved\": true,\n+  \"scope\": \"Draft schema and exact metadata correction only. Mathematical reader plan acceptance and all future canary/gate/current-reader binding requirements from prior review remain unchanged. No canonical adoption, Test BODY review, gate success, Exposition Seal or PURIFIED approval.\",\n+  \"source_and_remaining_state_unchanged\": true\n+}"},{"sha":"0610de99535d84fc7a7217a565d0bd5dcb87be99","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-integration/fresh-independent-integration-plan-review-v1.json","status":"added","additions":148,"deletions":0,"changes":148,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-plan-review-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-plan-review-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-integration-plan-review-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,148 @@\n+{\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:50:47.157590+00:00\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model\": \"GPT-6 Astra\",\n+  \"requested_effort\": \"medium\",\n+  \"runtime_independently_attested\": false,\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-bounded-reader-plan; metadata-draft-repair-before-adoption\",\n+  \"reader_mathematics_and_append_structure\": \"accepted\",\n+  \"canonical_application_authorized\": false,\n+  \"approved_reader_plan_sha256\": \"edd78e3b329bca4a50c03cc30449698e57397a17e62a840547f3521c613298b0\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"M1\",\n+      \"path\": \"/semantic_roundtrip/verdict\",\n+      \"artifact\": \"contribution-manifest-draft-v1.json\",\n+      \"required\": \"Use exact enum accepted-with-explicit-delta; relocate frozen-production-signature scope and binding reference into remaining_semantic_delta or a separate evidence field. Preserve bounded semantic scope, not package acceptance.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"M2\",\n+      \"path\": \"/progress_updates/teaching_route\",\n+      \"artifact\": \"contribution-manifest-draft-v1.json\",\n+      \"required\": \"Use allowed updated: or no-change-with-reason: prefix with honest draft/current wording; set actual added-card wording only after application.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"M3\",\n+      \"path\": \"/progress_updates/results_ledger\",\n+      \"artifact\": \"contribution-manifest-draft-v1.json\",\n+      \"required\": \"Use allowed updated: or no-change-with-reason: prefix, retaining candidate/gates-pending distinction.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"validation\": \"Read-only existing validate_contract returned exactly these three errors. No full contributor gate, site build or proof compilation was run.\",\n+  \"mathematics\": [\n+    \"The complete equality preserves psi(T-1,u)-psi(0,y0), the within-G difference, signed interior drift, and positive G(T-1,z)-G(T-1,u) term.\",\n+    \"Zero-based source s to t=s-1 mapping and inclusive G are explicit. T>0 remains the sole propositional premise; T1 has empty interior sum and no T0 theorem is claimed.\",\n+    \"Only unscored coordinateT is replaced by arbitraryz; earlier scored states equalx. u andz independent. The prose correctly distinguishes final comparator regularizer from initial played regularizer.\",\n+    \"The H_t proof explanation is correct: regularizer terms telescope to psi0(y0)-psi(T-1,z), loss-prefix terms to sum loss_t(y_t)-H_T(z), then the endpoint recovers comparator regret. This teaching argument is not mislabeled as actual proof-term topology.\",\n+    \"Arbitrary carrier and total-real functions are explicit algebra-interface deltas. No actual optimistic-FTRL/BTRL, EReal support/attainment, stability or Young endpoint is claimed.\",\n+    \"Selected actual VALUE occurrences Nat.recAux, Finset.sum_range_succ, Finset.sum_range_zero,Nat.sub_add_cancel are correct. Empty website dependencies avoids inventing project-registry nodes for external parents; notes retain occurrence provenance without necessity/transitive claims.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"structure_checks\": {\n+    \"all_current_input_hashes_equal_proposal_preconditions\": true,\n+    \"all_metadata_input_bindings_equal_current_bytes\": true,\n+    \"operations\": 3,\n+    \"operations_are_only_append_one_moduleglob_one_sourcecard_one_highlight\": true,\n+    \"in_memory_reversal_recovers_every_whole_old_parsed_object\": true,\n+    \"old_sourcecards\": 22,\n+    \"proposed_sourcecards\": 23,\n+    \"new_highlights\": 1,\n+    \"new_public_production_declarations\": 1,\n+    \"existing_objects_modified\": 0\n+  },\n+  \"metadata_semantics\": [\n+    \"Schema3 required blocks are present; pure validator failures are exactly M1-M3.\",\n+    \"Native hT source-assumption list is nonempty and correct; eight atomic binders/two literal lets introduce no EXCESS bundle.\",\n+    \"One serial mathematical route is correctly separated from independent blind/source/topology/BODY reviewers. No second verified OR route is asserted.\",\n+    \"29 source nodes,4 exclusions,0 verified source edges remain source topology, not actual implementation graph or29 accepted results.\",\n+    \"Current failure_class NONE refers to the recovered accepted production candidate; retained IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED and ENV_BLOCKED history is explicit.\",\n+    \"Reader flags are prospective contract commitments, not observation of rendered output. Purification and Exposition Seal pending are honest; no PURIFIED claim.\",\n+    \"Tests are outside protected affected_files under the current checker; nevertheless final consumer/source/evidence bindings must be explicit before adoption/acceptance.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"required_successor_bindings_before_final_delivery\": [\n+    {\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"/patches/website~1content~1readings.json/0/value/local_status/boundary\",\n+        \"/patches/website~1content~1highlights.json/0/value/lean_notes\"\n+      ],\n+      \"requirement\": \"When actual canary review succeeds, replace current pending-canary prose by exact achieved status. Keep combined gates pending until they pass. Final completed reader must not retain stale pending; preserve v2 as historical proposal.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"/reuse_plan/known_consumers\",\n+        \"/reuse_plan/planned_consumers\",\n+        \"/verification/focused_checks\",\n+        \"/truth_boundary\",\n+        \"/target\"\n+      ],\n+      \"requirement\": \"After distinct complete canary review, bind exact two Test full names, actual source hash, frozen headers, first-conjunct consumption, actual compiled VALUE/axiom/fence receipts and independent review. Do not promote future analytic adapters into actual consumers.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"/verification/bandit_check\",\n+        \"/verification/site_build\",\n+        \"/verification/site_check\",\n+        \"/verification/independent_review\",\n+        \"/graph_contribution/visual_review\",\n+        \"/learning_contract/reader_backpressure\"\n+      ],\n+      \"requirement\": \"Replace prospective fields only using fresh same-candidate root/Tests/full harness/site/render/FINAL evidence; keep purification pending unless separately justified. Preserve no whole-chapter/B4 closure.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"MANIFEST-append-proposal-v1.md\",\n+        \"proof-digestion-draft-v1.json\"\n+      ],\n+      \"requirement\": \"Use append-only successor records for actual current status and source-first chronology; bind canonical evidence paths when porting. Draft prose must not be represented as completed validation.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"remaining_boundary\": {\n+    \"containers_open\": 7,\n+    \"future_claims_open\": 6,\n+    \"B4\": \"OPEN\",\n+    \"Chapter2\": \"partial\",\n+    \"accepted\": false,\n+    \"denominator\": null,\n+    \"Goal\": \"ACTIVE\",\n+    \"unmerged_unpublished\": true,\n+    \"no_whole_native_loop_claim\": true\n+  },\n+  \"exposure\": \"Read production acceptance/export records and fixed integration inputs. Did not read unfinished canary BODY or execute gates; no canonical writes.\",\n+  \"inputs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-integration-proposal-v2-20261011/proposal-v2.json\",\n+      \"sha256_before\": \"edd78e3b329bca4a50c03cc30449698e57397a17e62a840547f3521c613298b0\",\n+      \"sha256_after\": \"edd78e3b329bca4a50c03cc30449698e57397a17e62a840547f3521c613298b0\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \