nding-canary/gates wording is truthful at proposal time. Before final reader delivery, append-only successors must bind actual complete canary consumers and evidence, then actual combined gates and render/FINAL; do not leave stale pending claims or prematurely assert success/PURIFIED. The29-node source topology has zero verified edges; only one implementation route is accepted. Whole B4, seven containers and six future claims remain open; Goal ACTIVE.\n+\n+No canonical application, Test BODY review or gate execution was performed. Requested Astra/medium, runtime not independently attested."},{"sha":"eaaeca264c5083b75313619443eb608214d3315b","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-integration/fresh-independent-reader-v3-supplement-v1.json","status":"added","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changes":37,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-reader-v3-supplement-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-reader-v3-supplement-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-integration%2Ffresh-independent-reader-v3-supplement-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+{\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:57:12.288595+00:00\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium; runtime not independently attested\",\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-bounded-reader-integration-successor\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [],\n+  \"approved_proposal_sha256\": \"417bee256fbabcc0862067fdf4c4bfdddf857b628dd06aa9b380ea5e9712ea96\",\n+  \"prior_pro